            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="work">
          <div class="work-img"><img src="/projects/digital-path.png" alt="Landing page Digital Path" loading="lazy" /></div>
          <div class="work-body">
            <p class="w-tag">LANDING PAGE • UI ENGINEERING</p>
            <h3>Digital Path — Bangun Jalan Digitalmu</h3>
            <p>Landing course pemrograman dengan tipografi display bold, section gelap sinematik, dan CTA pendaftaran.</p>
