          <p>Board desain 40+ layar: auth, home, notifikasi, kelas, checkout, hingga exam — setiap flow diprototipe sebelum satu baris kode ditulis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="figma-img"><img src="/projects/rumaysho-app-figma.png" alt="Board desain Figma aplikasi Rumaysho Academy" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="kontak" class="section container">
      <div class="contact">
        <p class="eyebrow center"><span class="line"></span> 05 — CONTACT ME <span class="line"></span></p>
        <h2 class="h2 center">Punya project <span class="grad">ambisius?</span><br />Mari diskusi.</h2>
        <p class="muted center">Basis Karawang — terbuka remote worldwide • Respon &lt; 24 jam</p>
        <div class="cta-row center">
          <a href="mailto:mujahidmuslim0@gmail.com" class="btn-neon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mujahidmuslim0@gmail.com ✉</a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/6283873463780" class="btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chat WhatsApp</a>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="label">EMAIL</p>
            <p>mujahidmuslim0@gmail.com</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="label">SOSIAL</p>
            <p class="social-list">
              <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-mujahid-muslim-08b15a221" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/Sanmu3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="label">DOKUMEN</p>
            <p class="social-list">
              <a href="/Profile.pdf" download>Download CV ↓</a>
              <a href="#karya">Lihat Karya ↑</a>
